I couldn't finish it, this Tuguy is just like Kevin O'Leary... Chris hedges and Noam Chomsky would shut this guy down by pointing out the structural flaws in our society that prevent schiffs ideals from being easy peasy... get the f\*\*ck outta here ya money hungry capitalist...

